{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971680/extras/d340352387eb4145a7840ed14b71f0bd.poster.avif?t=1757037642\" width=600 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971680/extras/d340352387eb4145a7840ed14b71f0bd.webm?t=1757037642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971680/extras/d340352387eb4145a7840ed14b71f0bd.mp4?t=1757037642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development process remains shrouded in mystery, hiding a <i>\u201cforbidden method\u201d</i> that has yet to be revealed. This isn\u2019t just technology\u2014it\u2019s a challenge to the very limits of AI\u2019s potential. Through an unknown creative process, the game delivers a unique worldview and experience unlike any Shogi title before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971680/extras/23ccc7b07d44058d3ee6817a6c751cc1.avif?t=1757037642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now is the time to uncover this secret. Witness the true essence of <strong>AI-designed Shogi</strong> with your own eyes. A new chapter in the history of Shogi begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971680/extras/06e2881719dab445bc883f0aef84e5fb.avif?t=1757037642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose freely from 5 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement range display helps beginners play with confidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined, beautif